              },
              {
                "name": "sort",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Sorting order"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Allows searching for workorder events matching specific criteria.\r\n\r\n> Param           | Default&nbsp; | Example&nbsp; | Description\r\n> ----------------|---------|---------|----\r\n> `eventType`     |         | task_created | Event codes that should be returned\r\n> `withTotalCount` | false  | true    | If total count of matched records should be returned in response header `x-total-count\r\n> `pageSize`      | 20      | 100     | Allows specifying how many records per page should be returned\r\n> `page"
        },
        {
